  // --- reference-length windows ---------------------------------------------------
  // Verified clone-pilot facts (artifacts/tts_matrix_pilot/tts_matrix_report.md,
  // 2026-09-28/29; real Star Trek refs, scored by user ear + qwen3_asr word match):
  //   cosyvoice3     15 s GOOD | 30 s SILENT TEXT TRUNCATION (sounds fine, tail
  //                  words dropped, ASR 0.10/0.67) | 35 s GOOD | 66 s COLLAPSE
  //                  (1.7 s output, ASR ~0). Earlier runtime-side sighting:
  //                  ap-0079 (65.86 s ent_data ref) -> ~20 min synth, 0.1 s output.
