          // always returned `j.text` uncut, so while the harness ran nobody saw the cut and it looked
          // optical. What it touched was the only copy that survives a restart: the restore path
          // reads this file, so after a restart the row in memory IS the clipped row, and `retry_job`
          // re-dispatches from the row it finds there. Measured 2026-10-27 on the live store:
          // ap-0249, ap-0254, ap-0258, ap-0259, ap-0260 and ap-0261 each stored 4012 characters of a
          // text the lane itself recorded as 812 words (`ev:"render" words=812`), every one ending in
