  // Read out of the plugin's own perf log (perf_log.jsonl, in the plugin's data directory, read 2026-10-16),
  // three rows in a row, each one a real dispatch that loaded its model and uploaded its file first:
  //   ap-0524  htdemucs_q8  e-10 (Vulkan node)  "curl exit 22: HTDemucs prepare() sample rate mismatch: expected 44100, got 48000"
