  // PERF LOG: every attempt lands in perf_log.jsonl — timings,
  // sizes, word counts — the raw material for spotting bad engines/quants/voices
  // and for the load-time vs generate-time analysis.

  // --- perf log — append-only JSONL of every remote action -------------------
  // One record per line; fields are flat and stable. Written through the shell
  // (append needs no fs append API), fire-and-forget: logging must NEVER break or
