  // --- LOG COVERAGE — the four writers -----------------------------------------------------
  // Every action the plugin receives is meant to leave an entry in the local plugin log. The gap
  // this chunk closes was measured against the LIVE perf_log.jsonl on 2026-10-07: ap-0016 (a batch
  // part, 298 867 ms of generation) and ap-0017 (a plain take, 17 s) both ended `error` on the
  // Vulkan node, with the body that engine returned:
  //   curl exit 22 ... error: 500 | body: vk::Queue::submit: ErrorDeviceLost
