  // is a sub-class of a wedge-like empty reply). This turns those booleans into one word so the
  // log can be queried by class. `unclassified` is reported, not invented: it is the honest name
  // for a failure none of the rules claims.
  // `device_lost` is the wedge-family member the log could not name before — the live Vulkan 500
