  // connErr is what put it in the family, devLostErr only says WHICH member.
  // `engine_refusal` is named AFTER `capability` and BEFORE `unclassified`, in the guard's own order. The two
  // are different claims: a capability rejection says "this engine cannot do that", an engine refusal says "this
