          job.transcript = text;
          // The row already carries speaker_turns for the diar lane and the panel
          // already renders them. ASR turns ride the SAME owned shape (seconds, not samples) so
          // restore/render/state agree. `text` stays the transcript even when turns are present -
          // the plain transcript is what every existing consumer (and the ASR word-ratio scoring)
